   "date": "2026-06-23",
   "title": "今年は7月！「下北沢盆踊り2026」7/25・26開催",
   "html": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2026年7月25日（土）26日（日）の2日間にわたり下北沢駅前広場にて、「下北沢盆踊り2026」が開催されます。昨年は8月でしたが、今年は7月に開催されます。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1410\" height=\"2000\" src=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bonodori2026-flyer-1.jpg\" alt=\"「下北沢盆踊り2026」\" class=\"wp-image-75784\" srcset=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bonodori2026-flyer-1.jpg 1410w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bonodori2026-flyer-1-1083x1536.jpg 1083w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bonodori2026-flyer-1-512x726.jpg 512w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bonodori2026-flyer-1-1024x1452.jpg 1024w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bonodori2026-flyer-1-920x1305.jpg 920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1410px) 100vw, 1410px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">「下北沢盆踊り2026」</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1420\" height=\"2000\" src=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bonodori2026-flyer-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-75786\" srcset=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bonodori2026-flyer-2.jpg 1420w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bonodori2026-flyer-2-1091x1536.jpg 1091w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bonodori2026-flyer-2-512x721.jpg 512w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bonodori2026-flyer-2-1024x1442.jpg 1024w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bonodori2026-flyer-2-920x1296.jpg 920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1420px) 100vw, 1420px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">昨年に引き続き下北沢駅前の広場で開催されることになった『下北沢盆踊り2026』、この駅前広場で開催される代表的なイベントになりました。。駅前広場には櫓が設けられ全体が盆踊りのエリアになり、露天は広場の柵の外側やオオゼキ横の歩道、さらにはピーコック跡地の前の路上も使われ、更に規模が拡大しました。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">露天エリアは13時から盆踊りエリアは14時からオープンし、毎年大盛り上がりのサンバショーやライブ＆パフォーマンスが行われます。盆踊り自体は16時からスタート、20時までノンストップで盆踊りが続きます。</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3240.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3240.jpg\" alt=\"「下北沢盆踊り2025」の模様\" class=\"wp-image-69914\" srcset=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3240.jpg 2000w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3240-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3240-512x341.jpg 512w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3240-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3240-920x613.jpg 920w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3240-1600x1066.jpg 1600w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3240-1920x1280.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">「下北沢盆踊り2025」の模様</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3273.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-69918\" srcset=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3273.jpg 2000w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3273-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3273-512x341.jpg 512w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3273-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3273-920x613.jpg 920w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3273-1600x1066.jpg 1600w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3273-1920x1280.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">「下北沢盆踊り2025」の模様</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3495.jpg\" alt=\"「下北沢盆踊り2025」の模様\" class=\"wp-image-69929\" srcset=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3495.jpg 2000w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3495-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3495-512x341.jpg 512w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3495-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3495-920x613.jpg 920w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3495-1600x1066.jpg 1600w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3495-1920x1280.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">「下北沢盆踊り2025」の模様</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3548.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-69932\" srcset=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3548.jpg 2000w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3548-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3548-512x341.jpg 512w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3548-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3548-920x613.jpg 920w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3548-1600x1066.jpg 1600w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3548-1920x1280.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">「下北沢盆踊り2025」の模様</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3879.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-69941\" srcset=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3879.jpg 2000w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3879-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3879-512x341.jpg 512w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3879-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3879-920x613.jpg 920w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3879-1600x1066.jpg 1600w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_3879-1920x1280.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">「下北沢盆踊り2025」の模様</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_4482.jpg\" alt=\"「下北沢盆踊り2025」の模様\" class=\"wp-image-69949\" srcset=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_4482.jpg 2000w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_4482-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_4482-512x341.jpg 512w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_4482-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_4482-920x613.jpg 920w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_4482-1600x1066.jpg 1600w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_4482-1920x1280.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">「下北沢盆踊り2025」の模様</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_8653.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-69952\" srcset=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_8653.jpg 2000w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_8653-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_8653-512x341.jpg 512w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_8653-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_8653-920x613.jpg 920w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_8653-1600x1066.jpg 1600w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSC_8653-1920x1280.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">「下北沢盆踊り2025」の模様</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">［2026/07/25 追記］</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">当日の会場MAPが公開されました！</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6885-scaled.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6885-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"下北沢盆踊り 2026 会場MAP\" class=\"wp-image-76432\" srcset=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6885-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6885-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6885-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6885-512x341.jpg 512w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6885-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6885-920x613.jpg 920w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6885-1600x1067.jpg 1600w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6885-1920x1280.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">下北沢盆踊り 2026 会場MAP</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6886-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"下北沢盆踊り 2026 会場MAP\" class=\"wp-image-76433\" srcset=\"https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6886-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6886-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6886-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6886-512x341.jpg 512w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6886-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6886-920x613.jpg 920w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6886-1600x1067.jpg 1600w, https://www.shimokitazawa.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_6886-1920x1280.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">下北沢盆踊り 2026 会場MAP</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">『下北沢盆踊り2026』</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">日時：2026年7月25日（土）・26日（日）13:00~20:00<br>場所：下北沢東口駅前広場<br>内容：盆踊り／盆踊りレクチャー、サンバパフォーマンス、アイドルグループステージ、ダンスグループステージ、露店、かえっこバザール、ヨーヨー釣り<br>主催：しもきた商店街振興組合、下北沢東会（あずま通り商店街）、下北沢南口商店街振興組合<br>後援：世田谷区、公益財団法人世田谷区産業振興公社、世田谷まちなか観光交流協会</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
